<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets 12 bln drachma five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets 12 bln drachma five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Merrill Lynch and Cassa di Risparmio delle Provincie Lombarde.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MERRILL LYNCH AND CO INC</p>
<p> AMT     12 BLN GRD   COUPON     9.40	MATURITY    08.AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.455   PAY DATE    08.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.88     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 250	 SALE LIMITS US/GR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.375     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
